   "source": [
    "# PHAGLP Model Eval on Kaggle\n\nCompare Qwen3-Coder 30B-A3B vs Gemma 4 12B QAT on real PHAGLP codebase prompts.\n\n## Before running\n1. Add `GITHUB_TOKEN` as a Kaggle notebook secret (GitHub PAT with `repo` scope)\n2. Set Accelerator to **GPU (T4 P100)**\n3. Enable **Internet** in notebook settings\n4. This notebook runs ~15–20 minutes depending on model\n\n## Models evaluated\n- `unsloth/Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct-GGUF` (MoE, ~30B total/~3B active)\n- `google/gemma-4-12b-it-qat-q4_0-gguf` (12B QAT, Q4_0)\n\n## VRAM note (T4 = 16 GB)\n- Gemma 12B Q4: ~7–8 GB \u2713 fits comfortably\n- Qwen3-Coder 30B-A3B Q4: ~15–20 GB \u26a0 may OOM; falls back to CPU if needed\n   "
   ]
  },
